<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p>Hi {{{Case.Contact_First_Name__c}}},</p>

<p>Thanks for your email, we’re sorry you have requested to stop the automatic renewal this year. Before proceeding with your request, for data protection can please provide us with:</p>

<ol>
	<li><b>First line of address</b></li>
	<li><b>Post code</b></li>
	<li><b>Date of birth</b></li>
</ol>

<p>Could you let us know why you're thinking of cancelling the renewal? If it’s due to pricing, we’d be happy to check with our renewal team to see if we can offer a discount and help you stay with us?<br />
<br />
Your loyalty has been appreciated, if you change your mind or your circumstances change, please don’t hesitate to get in touch for a quote.</p>
